  "description": "观澜 · 落子深度研判预案（减证据版，八节点）— the supported cheap tier beside the full ten-seat chain. It deliberately omits pv.technical and text.news, so every product must carry the reduced-evidence badge and state that technical-indicator and news evidence were never read. The remaining price-action, microstructure, sentiment and bounded bull/bear outputs are blocking typed inputs to dec.research_mgr; its ResearchPlan feeds dec.pm, whose PortfolioDecision feeds terminal dec.trader. No retained evidence seat is auxiliary decoration. The graph is code-agnostic; the committed RunSubject@2 carries symbol and evidence timeframe beside the plan. The budget reserves six primary LLM calls plus at most one schema-repair call per LLM seat under static-runtime-v2.",
